OL,3,GNEWSADenmark nurdles may be from Tyne
OL,4,Aspill, agency says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNurdles found along the Danish coast
OL,7,Fare likely to originate from the spill
OL,8,Fin north-east England, according to the
OL,9,Fcountry's environment agency.
OL,11,FMasses of plastic pellets were found
OL,12,Falong the western coast of Denmark in
OL,13,FSeptember.
OL,15,FThe Danish Environment Protection
OL,16,FAgency has now confirmed tests carried
OL,17,Fout on the microplastics suggest they
OL,18,Foriginated from the River Tyne spill in
OL,19,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
