OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADenmark nurdles may be from Tyne
OL,4,Aspill, agency says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the nurdles had the same
OL,7,Fcharacteristics as the one billion
OL,8,Fwhich had been spilled in north-east
OL,9,FEngland and their arrival in Denmark in
OL,10,Flate September and early October -
OL,11,Fabout 390 miles (630km) away - was
OL,12,Fconsistent with "current patterns and
OL,13,Fcirculation in the North Sea".
